Natural Earth  —  country centroids
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dataset:  ne_10m_admin_0_countries
Source:   https://www.naturalearthdata.com/
License:  Public domain.

    Made with Natural Earth. Free vector and raster map data at
    naturalearthdata.com.

Natural Earth places no restrictions on use. The attribution above is requested
by the project's terms of use and is reproduced here in full.

Since D-69 this is the source of every centroid, and so of every distance and
compass hint the game gives, but of no silhouette: the outlines are drawn
artwork from tools/country-shapes/, listed at the end of this file.


